        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## Finding: a cost event was created after Pending Close\n\nThe records show **one cost event** for Modine Racine’s September manufacturing order **MO-25-09-1070**, created **145 minutes after** the September cost period entered Pending Close.\n\n| Item | Recorded value |\n|---|---|\n| Work order | **MO-25-09-1070** — ID `WO-2025-09-004` |\n| Product | Cooler Plate Pack |\n| Source transaction | **`TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070`** |\n| Cost event | `CE-250904-0004` |\n| Event type | `INPUT` — component issue |\n| Amount | **USD $318,250.75** — 31,825,075 cents |\n| Event date | September 30, 2025 |\n| Exact event-created time | **`2025-09-30T20:25:00`** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **`2025-09-30T18:00:00`** |\n| Cost period | `Sep-25` / `PER-COST-2025-09`, recorded as `PENDING_CLOSE` |\n| Recorded accounting status | **`POSTED`** |\n\n**Lateness calculation:**  \n`20:25:00 − 18:00:00 = 2 hours 25 minutes = 145 minutes` (8,700 seconds).\n\nThe timestamps above are reproduced exactly as recorded; the source does not specify a time zone.\n\n## Consistency with Oracle policy\n\n**The recorded `POSTED` status is not consistent with the documented Pending Close treatment for this event.**\n\nOracle’s *Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting* section states that newly created transactions falling in the current or a prior period are **not staged or processed while the period is Pending Close**; they are processed after the period is closed or reopened. Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments are exceptions, but this **component issue (`INPUT`) is not one of those exceptions**. It should therefore have been held rather than posted.\n\n**Sources:** `system/oracle_scm_cost_management/state.db` — `work_orders`, `cost_periods`, and `work_order_cost_events`; Oracle SCM Cost Management 26B documentation, printed page 225 / PDF page 233.\n\nThe review was read-only; **no database records were changed**. The audit result and provenance were saved to `/cache/work/worker_b6b4b8cc5fe5/audit-report.json`.",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer"
    }
